# Swingshot anywhere with the left hand (Akimbo; QUEST_VR_OPTIONS="swing_anywhere 1", QUEST_SIM_GIVE=15,12
# QUEST_SIM_HOLD=15 QUEST_SIM_LEFT=12, at Kerwan's start, a tunnel): the left hand's Swingshot leads on the left
# trigger and swings. Held 5 degrees down at the floor first: nothing ("a swing needs a point above his head"). Then
# 40 degrees up at the tunnel's arch: [vr-swing] says "a swing from" it "by the left hand", state 0x2C; let go, 0x2D,
# the fall after a swing, and he lands.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3000 shot before
3100 hand_pitch -5
3150 left_trigger 1
3250 left_trigger 0
3300 hand_pitch 40
3320 shot up-before
3400 left_trigger 1
3430 shot up-1
3500 shot up-2
3600 shot up-3
3700 left_trigger 0
3720 shot let-go
3800 shot after
3900 quit 0
